CHAPTER.VERS:
And Yahweh spoke suddenly to Moses, and to Aaron, and to Miriam, You

          {+}
         three come out to the tent of meeting. And the three of them came out.

And he said, Now hear my words: if there is a prophet among you

          {+}
        , I Yahweh will make myself known to him in a vision, I will speak with him in a dream.

with him I will speak mouth to mouth, even manifestly, and not in dark speeches; and the form of Yahweh he will see: why then were you

          {+}
         not afraid to speak against my slave, against Moses?
